                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The only record of the substance of this meeting that has been found is in
                        Stettinius, <ref target="#pg67">pp.
                        67</ref>–<ref target="#pg68">68</ref>. The meeting lasted until “almost
                    midnight”. The information given here as to the meeting and the participants is
                    taken from Stettinius, <ref
                        target="#pg67">p. 67</ref>.</p>
            </div>
